# MoQ livestreams

When touching anything related to **MoQ livestreams** (packages, composables, migrations, player/relay config, `@moq/*` deps, or livestream APIs), follow the official MoQ agent instructions:

**https://doc.moq.dev/setup/agent/prompt.md**

That prompt installs the MoQ skill (`npx -y skills add moq-dev/moq --yes`) and documents architecture, `@moq/*` packages, relay setup, and common pitfalls. Do not improvise MoQ integration without following those instructions first.
